// (Jordan retros, Dunks, Air Max, New Balance, adidas terrace, ASICS, Salomon…), the 2025–2026 releases weighted up;
// no Yeezy. Every number the demo shows about these products (sales, stock, links) is generated by lib/demo/sample.ts.
// Pure data (no I/O, no "@/" imports): node --test can load it.

